---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">Self-taught / software developer</p>
			<h1 class="display">I build things<br />with <em>curiosity.</em></h1>
			<p class="hero-intro muted">A developer exploring the space between a good idea and the software that makes it real. Web, Python, Rust, and the systems underneath.</p>
			<div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/projects">Explore my work <span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/about">A little about me <span>→</span></a></div>
		</div>
		<div class="orbital" aria-hidden="true"><span class="orbit orbit-one"></span><span class="orbit orbit-two"></span><span class="orbit-dot"></span><span class="orbital-label">IDEAS<br />IN MOTION</span></div>
	</section>
	<section class="home-strip"><span>Currently exploring</span><strong>Rust <i>/</i> Embedded systems <i>/</i> Cybersecurity</strong><span class="strip-arrow">↗</span></section>
	<section class="project-preview">
		<div class="preview-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A few things I am building</p><h2>Projects in<br /><em>the making.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects">View all projects <span>→</span></a></div>
		<div class="preview-grid">
			<a class="preview-card syslook" href="/projects">
				<div class="card-top"><span>SYSLOOK</span><span class="status"><i></i> LIVE</span></div>
				<div class="monitor"><div class="monitor-value">42<span>%</span></div><div class="monitor-label">CPU LOAD</div><div class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
				<div class="card-bottom"><strong>System resource monitor</strong><span>↗</span></div>
			</a>
			<a class="preview-card mediaplayer" href="/projects">
				<div class="card-top"><span>MEDIAPLAYER</span><span class="card-index">02</span></div>
				<div class="album"><span>▶</span><b>VL<br />C</b></div><div class="track"><span>01:24</span><div class="track-line"><i></i></div><span>03:48</span></div><div class="player-controls"><span>↶</span><strong>▶</strong><span>↷</span></div>
				<div class="card-bottom"><strong>Powered by libVLC</strong><span>↗</span></div>
			</a>
			<a class="preview-card converter" href="/projects">
				<div class="card-top"><span>MEDIA CONVERTER</span><span class="card-index">03</span></div>
				<div class="convert-flow"><div><b>MP4</b><small>source.mov</small></div><span>→</span><div class="output"><b>WEBM</b><small>ready to export</small></div></div><div class="progress"><i></i></div>
				<div class="card-bottom"><strong>Format conversion utility</strong><span>↗</span></div>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="home-grid">
		<div><p class="eyebrow">The short version</p><h2>Thoughtful software,<br /><em>built from the ground up.</em></h2></div>
		<p class="muted">I learn by reading documentation, experimenting, solving problems, and making the thing myself. The result is software that is practical, efficient, and built with purpose.</p>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.hero { position: relative; min-height: 680px; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 150px 0 100px; }
	.hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 720px; animation: rise .8s ease both; }
	.hero-intro { max-width: 490px; margin: 30px 0; font-size: 16px; }
	.hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; }
	.text-link { color: #aaa3b0; font-size: 14px; }.text-link span { margin-left: 7px; color: #a58cff; }.text-link:hover { color: #fff; }
	.orbital { position: absolute; top: 100px; right: -110px; width: 480px; height: 480px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 48% 45%, rgba(107, 71, 231, .36), rgba(48, 27, 102, .15) 38%, transparent 68%); animation: breathe 7s ease-in-out infinite; }
	.orbit { position: absolute; inset: 25px; border: 1px solid rgba(158, 132, 255, .25); border-radius: 50%; transform: rotate(-26deg) scaleY(.38); }.orbit-two { inset: 78px -30px; transform: rotate(52deg) scaleY(.72); border-color: rgba(158, 132, 255, .13); }.orbit-dot { position: absolute; top: 80px; left: 75px; width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; background: #aa95ff; box-shadow: 0 0 24px 8px rgba(143, 109, 255, .75); }.orbital-label { position: absolute; right: 84px; bottom: 98px; color: rgba(224, 216, 255, .45); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .22em; line-height: 1.5; }
	.home-strip { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 38px; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 21px 0; border-top: 1px solid #27242b; border-bottom: 1px solid #27242b; color: #77717c; font-size: 12px; }.home-strip strong { color: #c6c0cb; font-weight: 500; }.home-strip i { margin: 0 13px; color: #7e5df2; font-style: normal; }.strip-arrow { margin-left: auto; color: #8e70f7; font-size: 18px; }
	.project-preview { margin-top: 105px; padding: 85px max(20px, calc((100% - 1120px) / 2)) 90px; border-top: 1px solid #312644; border-bottom: 1px solid #312644; background: #171220; background-image: linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(100, 63, 188, .12), transparent 42%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%, rgba(87, 50, 170, .12), transparent 35%); }
	.preview-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 48px; }.preview-heading h2 { margin: 22px 0 0; font-size: clamp(35px, 4vw, 55px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.07em; line-height: .98; }.preview-heading h2 em { color: #a58cff; font-family: "DM Serif Display", serif; font-weight: 400; }.preview-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }.preview-card { position: relative; display: flex; min-height: 290px; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; overflow: hidden; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #393047; border-radius: 5px; background: #211b2b; transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s; }.preview-card:hover { border-color: #8b6ef1; transform: translateY(-4px); }.card-top, .card-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #94889f; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .13em; }.card-top span:first-child { color: #cbc1d4; }.card-index { color: #756b80; }.status { color: #79d99c; }.status i { display: inline-block; width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-right: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background: #79d99c; }.card-bottom { align-items: end; color: #bcb1c5; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }.card-bottom strong { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }.card-bottom span { color: #a487ff; font-size: 18px; }.monitor { align-self: center; width: 80%; padding: 23px 18px 12px; border: 1px solid #44345d; border-radius: 4px; background: #171321; box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(4, 2, 9, .28); }.monitor-value { color: #e8e0f2; font-size: 44px; letter-spacing: -.08em; }.monitor-value span { color: #916df3; font-size: 17px; }.monitor-label { margin-top: -2px; color: #746982; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .18em; }.bars { display: flex; align-items: end; gap: 3px; height: 44px; margin-top: 18px; }.bars i { width: 100%; height: 30%; background: #7959d8; }.bars i:nth-child(2) { height: 55%; }.bars i:nth-child(3) { height: 38%; }.bars i:nth-child(4) { height: 75%; }.bars i:nth-child(5) { height: 51%; }.bars i:nth-child(6) { height: 90%; }.bars i:nth-child(7) { height: 66%; }.mediaplayer { background: #1e1929; }.album { display: grid; place-items: center; align-self: center; width: 106px; height: 106px; border: 1px solid #7457ca; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 38% 35%, #987bfa, #3a236e 60%, #1d1830); color: #e3dbfa; box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(110, 73, 214, .24); }.album b { font-family: "DM Serif Display", serif; font-size: 25px; line-height: .75; text-align: center; }.album span { position: absolute; margin-top: 130px; color: #a992f3; font-size: 9px; }.track { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: #82768e; font-size: 8px; }.track-line, .progress { flex: 1; height: 2px; background: #493c5b; }.track-line i, .progress i { display: block; width: 40%; height: 100%; background: #a188ff; }.player-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 24px; margin-top: 8px; color: #81758e; }.player-controls strong { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 29px; height: 29px; border-radius: 50%; background: #7954e8; color: white; font-size: 11px; }.convert-flow { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; color: #a48aff; }.convert-flow > span { color: #71617d; font-size: 20px; }.convert-flow div { display: grid; gap: 5px; padding: 17px 13px; border: 1px solid #49385e; border-radius: 3px; background: #191522; }.convert-flow b { color: #e1d9ee; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; }.convert-flow small { color: #796d85; font-size: 9px; }.convert-flow .output { border-color: #6f56b1; }.progress { flex: none; width: 100%; height: 3px; margin-top: 14px; }.progress i { width: 68%; }
	.home-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 100px; max-width: 1120px; margin: 110px auto 0; }.home-grid h2 { margin: 22px 0 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 53px); letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 500; }.home-grid h2 em { color: #a58cff; font-family: "DM Serif Display", serif; font-weight: 400; }.home-grid > .muted { max-width: 370px; align-self: end; }
	@keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } } @keyframes breathe { 50% { transform: scale(1.05); opacity: .8; } }
	@media (max-width: 760px) { .hero { min-height: 620px; padding: 110px 20px 70px; }.hero-intro { font-size: 15px; }.orbital { top: 170px; right: -230px; opacity: .55; }.home-strip { margin: 0 20px; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }.home-strip strong { width: 100%; order: 3; }.project-preview { margin-top: 75px; padding-block: 65px; }.preview-heading { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: 25px; }.preview-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.preview-card { min-height: 270px; }.home-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; margin: 75px 20px 0; } }
</style>
